        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "retiam/shapes supplies option-driven paths for stars, squircles, hearts, crosses, gears, teardrops, chevrons, curved/double arrows, architectural profiles, spirals, waveforms, diamonds, trapezoids, parallelograms and crescents. It also exposes additional arc, annulus, regular-polygon, sector and wedge helpers. These inherit Path behavior, so effects, modifiers, transforms and sampling remain available."
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "The current index contains more shapes than older “16 shapes” catalog counts imply. The shapes API lists every exported class and options interface; use that as the inventory."
        },
        {
          "type": "code",
          "language": "typescript",
          "code": "import { Star, Heart, Gear2D } from \"retiam/shapes\";\nconst star = new Star({ points: 5, outerRadius: 2, innerRadius: 0.9 });\nconst heart = new Heart({ width: 2.5, height: 2.5 });\nconst gear = new Gear2D({ teeth: 12, outerRadius: 1.8, rootRadius: 1.4 });\n// Add, place and animate these Path-derived entities in a Scene."
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "Exact contracts: [Star](/api-libs-shapes-2d#star), [Heart](/api-libs-shapes-2d#heart), [Gear2D](/api-libs-shapes-2d#gear2d), [Squircle](/api-libs-shapes-2d#squircle), [ArchitecturalProfile](/api-libs-shapes-2d#architecturalprofile), [Spiral2D](/api-libs-shapes-2d#spiral2d), [Waveform2D](/api-libs-shapes-2d#waveform2d)."
        }
      ]
