        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "Capsule, rounded box, prism, pyramid, Platonic solids, torus knot, helix, tube, ellipsoid, gear, truncated cone, wedge, diamond, bipyramid and superellipsoid generators create Model-compatible meshes. Radius, segment counts, topology, caps and profile parameters are shape-specific; do not assume all constructors accept the same positional arguments."
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "Exact contracts: [Capsule3D](/api-libs-shapes-3d#capsule3d), [RoundedBox3D](/api-libs-shapes-3d#roundedbox3d), [TorusKnot3D](/api-libs-shapes-3d#torusknot3d), [Tube3D](/api-libs-shapes-3d#tube3d), [Superellipsoid3D](/api-libs-shapes-3d#superellipsoid3d)."
